commit 3967dc082d873eb597c4124881ea0877c4537c2d

C03: a result URL is not a name to preserve in the truncated-word veto (KNOWLEDGE1511)

KNOWLEDGE1509 measured that «decime una curiosidad» searched «Colibrí» and every draft repeated the Atlas Animal snippet naming it, but `_truncated_fact_word` took «Atlas» for a cut of the glued host words of the result URL («atlasanimal») and no final was published. URL values are excluded from the truncation check, as snippets already were; the rest of the veto is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


